# Full-CF deploy credential. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in the token — scripts/provision_cf.sh
# + scripts/finish_cf.sh auto-source a repo-root `.env` (the single, repo-self-contained source; no
# ~/.cf-token). The deploy spans ui/ → Pages and worker/ → the Worker.
#
# ONLY the token lives here. `account_id` is pinned in worker/wrangler.toml (not secret — it appears in
# dashboard URLs), so CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID is NOT needed; a single-account token also auto-detects it.
#
# Minimal API-token scopes (Custom token): Account = Cloudflare Pages·Edit + Workers Scripts·Edit +
# D1·Edit + Workers AI·Read; Zone (sortmy.london) = Workers Routes·Edit + Zone·Read. (finish_cf.sh's
# first-time domain attach additionally needs Zone·DNS·Edit — one-time, already done.)
# Create at: https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#
# NOTE: runtime Worker secrets (OPENROUTER_KEY, ARIZE_API_KEY, ARIZE_SPACE_ID) do NOT belong here —
# set them with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` (prod) or worker/.dev.vars (local dev).

CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
